\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Pipeline bubbles on a faulting CXL address space (schematic). $y$ is in-flight fills; $D$ is the depth NAND parallelism needs. A single query cannot hold $D$; a blocking load/store is stuck at QD$\approx 1$; a static batch drains at the barrier. How the runtime issues across queries is\nonbreakingspace \S  \ref {sec:design}.}}{5}{figure.caption.9}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:mot-bubbles}{{4}{5}{Pipeline bubbles on a faulting CXL address space (schematic). $y$ is in-flight fills; $D$ is the depth NAND parallelism needs. A single query cannot hold $D$; a blocking load/store is stuck at QD$\approx 1$; a static batch drains at the barrier. How the runtime issues across queries is~\S \ref {sec:design}}{figure.caption.9}{}}
